'''Sy Myrthians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] from [[Sy Myrth]] who moved on one large "[[foot]]" (similar to the [[Hutt]]s). They were covered in short [[Hair|fur]] and had elongated heads.<ref name="TPM" /> Later some Sy Myrthians joined the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]], although not all Sy Myrthians joined [[Count]] [[Dooku]]'s movement.<ref name="Tarkin">[[Tarkin (novel)|''Tarkin'']]</ref> One part of [[the galaxy]] was known as [[Sy Myrthian space]].<ref name="Catalyst">''[[Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel]]''</ref>

==Sy Myrthians in the galaxy==
In [[14 BBY]], two Sy Myrthians made up the three-person crew of the [[freighter]] ''[[Reticent]]''. Following a [[Incident in the Obroa-skai system|hyperspace accident]] in the [[Obroa-skai system]], they were captured by the [[Galactic Empire]] alongside their [[Koorivar]] [[Unidentified Koorivar captain|captain]]. The Sy Myrthian [[navigator]] suffered [[heart]] failure under interrogation by [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]].<ref name="Tarkin" />

